    "description": "LIVE DEFECT. Autolaunched_Update_Payout_Amount is Active, but its only callers are Draft/Obsolete — so Payout_Amount__c is never populated on any Sign-Up. BUILD-32 was closed on the assumption this worked.\n\n* Re-point an active caller at the autolaunched flow, or inline the logic in the after-save path\n\n* Confirm the field type is correct — the Jul 29 audit flags it as wrong\n\n* Regression test against the payout matrix\n\n* MUST be verified before BUILD-75 deletes Sign_Up_After_Save_Update_Payout_Amount\n\nEffort: \\~1h. No dependencies.\n\nSource: Asana Reconciliation v2, 2026-07-29, §1.\n\nImpact: a field both reps and Ops read is silently empty. Raised to Urgent for that reason, not for its size.",
